## Sync model — GitHub only

- `git pull` **before** you start; `git push` **when** you finish.
- Never have two machines editing the **same branch** at the same time.
- Repo: `github.com/CCHDESIGNSTUDIO/CCH` · active branch `wip/preserve-rh-inspiration-board-2026-04-19`.
- Unlike Dropbox, git merges overlapping changes safely (or asks). It will not silently overwrite work.

